            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Chay An & Cafe - Phạm Thái Bường",
            "review_text": "Vy N\n1 contribution\n0\nenvironment, music, dishes, service staff\nMay 2025 • Friends\nI. Environment\nThe restaurant environment is elegant and peaceful, making people feel very relaxed.\nThe decor is simple and generous, full of Zen.\nThe light is soft and the atmosphere is warm for a quiet meal.\nII. Music\nThe background music is soft and beautiful, adding a lot of elegance to the meal.\nThe music atmosphere is very relaxing and physically and mentally pleasing.\nIII. Dishes\nEach dish is stunningly coloured and scented.\nIngredients are fresh, seasoned naturally and eaten healthy and reassuringly.\nVegetarian food is so exquisitely made it is an artistic treat.\nService personnel\nThe staff are friendly and courteous.\nThe service was very good and made people feel at home.\nThe staff are very professional and the details are in place.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Chinese\nShow original\nWritten May 21, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
